<title>USA: Labor Ready Nov same-store sales up 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Labor Ready Nov same-store sales up 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TACOMA, Wash. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$17.0	 $9.6	 +78	  +24</p>
<p>Year-to-date$   $143.8	$83.5	 +72	  +24</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is November.</p>
<p>Full company name is Labor Ready Inc.</p>
<p>NOTE: November 1996 included one extra day versus the year-ago month. Excluding this day, same-store sales were up 18 pct over the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
